      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting “%@” removes all %lld photos, every subject filed in it, its conversations, its setup and its history, for everyone who uses it. Nothing can be recovered afterwards, not even by support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除“%1$@”会移除其中全部 %2$lld 张照片、所有已归档的对象、对话、设置和历史版本，所有使用这个合集的人都会看不到。删除后无法找回，客服也无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describe the change": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描述要改的地方"
