      }
    },
    "Each photo is kept by where and when it was taken": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每张照片按拍摄地点和时间归好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each workspace has its own scenario, subjects and photos. Swipe to remove one from this phone; its photos stay on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个工作区都有自己的场景、对象和照片。左滑可以从这台手机上移除，照片仍保留在服务器上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a full URL, for example http://192.168.1.10:8080": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入完整网址，例如 http://192.168.1.10:8080"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Equipment maintenance: each device has a label with its serial number; we photograph its condition and every repair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备维护：每台设备贴着序列号标签，我们拍它的状况和每一次维修。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
