    "Find photos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find photos, ask what they show, or what is not photographed yet. Follow-ups build on what came before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找照片、问照片里有什么，或者还有什么没拍到。后面的话可以接着前面说。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First photos: each one close up, face on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一批照片：每一只都靠近拍，拍正脸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First photos: start with the label or ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一批照片：先拍标签或编号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example: “Add a tag for sunburn” or “Remove the flower and fruit tags.” Everything else stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：“加一个晒伤标签”或“去掉开花和结果标签”。其他内容保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For: %@": {
