    "Tell %@ apart by a label or number on them, not by how they look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按%@身上的标签或编号来区分，不要靠外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell %@ apart by how they look, not by a label.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按外观来区分%@，不要靠标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell me what you photograph, what you will want to find later, and how you tell one from another. I will set the collection up, and you can keep changing it here, now or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉我你要拍什么、以后想找什么，以及靠什么区分每一个。我来把合集建好；之后想改，随时回到这里接着说。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app follows your iPhone's language unless you pick one for Pidex in Settings. Scenario names and tags stay in the language they were written in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 默认跟随 iPhone 的语言，也可以在“设置”里为 Pidex 单独选择。场景里的名称和标签保持创建时的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera shoots for this collection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机正在为这个合集拍照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone could not start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风无法启动：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model could not produce a valid scenario. Try describing it differently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没能生成有效的场景，换一种说法再试试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model did not answer in time. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有及时响应，请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo could not be taken: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法拍照：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are removed for everyone, with their tags and their place in conversations. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有人都将看不到它们，标签和对话里引用它们的地方也一起删除。删除后无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后无法恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is where “%@” was set up. Say what to change, such as a missing tag or another way to tell them apart; nothing changes until you apply it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”就是在这里建的。说说要改什么，比如少了一个标签，或换一种区分方式；点“应用修改”之前不会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server has no model set up for designing scenarios.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台服务器还没有配置用于设计场景的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
